{
  "$comment": "Authoritative decision-case table for scripts/port-tick/overrides.ts — the twelfth decision family (#246). Per plugins/port/docs/PIPELINE.md → 'CLAUDE.md overrides'. parseOverrides cases exercise the grammar; applyOverrides cases exercise classification and value validation, each against its own inline base config so every case is self-contained.",
